            "subheading": "",
            "title": "<h2>Jewellery With Meaning</h2>",
            "description": "<p>Personal jewellery has always been at the heart of Natalie Marie Jewellery.</p><p>Our expanded selection of chains and charms offers greater freedom to create a necklace that speaks to your story. Each charm carries its own considered meaning, inviting you to select the pieces that resonate with you and pair them with the chain of your choice.</p><p>Each combination becomes deeply personal to its wearer - a considered expression of the people, moments and sentiments held close, designed for everyday wear.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Personal jewellery has always been at the heart of Natalie Marie Jewellery.</p><p>Our expanded selection of chains and charms offers greater freedom to create a necklace that speaks to your story. Each charm carries its own considered meaning, inviting you to select the pieces that resonate with you and pair them with the chain of your choice.</p><p>Each combination becomes deeply personal to its wearer - a considered expression of the people, moments and sentiments held close, designed for everyday wear.</p>",
            "colour_style": "dark",
