    "d94b5d55-eb15-4cf4-80d0-eaa6ad65a4fc": {
      "type": "content-list",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16177341137065__d94b5d55-eb15-4cf4-80d0-eaa6ad65a4fc-image-3": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "apply_overlay": false,
            "devices": "mobile_desktop",
            "content_position": "underLeft",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>Creating a necklace that feels entirely your own begins wherever you choose. You may be drawn to a charm and find the chain to complement it, or begin with a chain and curate the charms that will make it personal. Select your chosen chain and charms and add each piece to your cart.</p><p><strong><br/>Choose Your Chain</strong></p><p>From refined and delicate styles to more substantial silhouettes, and select the piece that best complements your chosen charms and personal style.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>Curate Your Charms</strong></p><p>Discover our collection of meaningful charms, each with its own considered sentiment. Choose the pieces that resonate with the people, moments and memories you hold close, or those you are simply instinctively drawn to. Brought together, each charm adds another layer of meaning, creating a necklace that is distinctly your own.<br/></p><p><strong><br/>Add a Personal Detail</strong></p><p>Selected charms can be personalised with a birthstone, offering a subtle way to represent yourself, your children, a partner, family member or someone you hold close.</p><p><strong><br/>Considered for Every Day</strong></p><p>To ensure the longevity of your necklace please consult our <strong>Charm Guide</strong> (found within each charm and chain product page) before making your selections. Here, you’ll find important guidance on the number of charms suited to each chain, as well as which charms can be worn together. Following this guidance will help you curate a considered combination designed to be worn and treasured for years to come.</p><p><strong><br/>Wear Your Story</strong></p><p>Your finished necklace becomes a personal collection of the people, memories and moments that hold meaning to you. And as your story evolves, so too can your piece - with the option to add new charms over time, creating an enduring reflection of what matters most.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Creating a necklace that feels entirely your own begins wherever you choose. You may be drawn to a charm and find the chain to complement it, or begin with a chain and curate the charms that will make it personal. Select your chosen chain and charms and add each piece to your cart.</p><p><strong><br/>Choose Your Chain</strong></p><p>From refined and delicate styles to more substantial silhouettes, and select the piece that best complements your chosen charms and personal style.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>Curate Your Charms</strong></p><p>Discover our collection of meaningful charms, each with its own considered sentiment. Choose the pieces that resonate with the people, moments and memories you hold close, or those you are simply instinctively drawn to. Brought together, each charm adds another layer of meaning, creating a necklace that is distinctly your own.<br/></p><p><strong><br/>Add a Personal Detail</strong></p><p>Selected charms can be personalised with a birthstone, offering a subtle way to represent yourself, your children, a partner, family member or someone you hold close.</p><p><strong><br/>Considered for Every Day</strong></p><p>To ensure the longevity of your necklace please consult our <strong>Charm Guide</strong> (found within each charm and chain product page) before making your selections. Here, you’ll find important guidance on the number of charms suited to each chain, as well as which charms can be worn together. Following this guidance will help you curate a considered combination designed to be worn and treasured for years to come.</p><p><strong><br/>Wear Your Story</strong></p><p>Your finished necklace becomes a personal collection of the people, memories and moments that hold meaning to you. And as your story evolves, so too can your piece - with the option to add new charms over time, creating an enduring reflection of what matters most.</p>",
            "colour_style": "dark",
